

>> Cat := Bagay bago.

Cat kapag: ['bago'] gawin: {
	sarili-ko sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat kapag: ['nieuw'] gawin: {
	sarili-ko sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat kapag: ['makeSound'] gawin: { <- sarili-ko sound.
}.

Cat kapag: ['greet'] gawin: { <- sarili makeSound.
}.

>> cat := Cat bago.
Labas isulat: cat greet.
